pymatgen test files
===================

tests/fixtures/qc/pymatgen/ holds unmodified copies of Gaussian input and
output files from materialsproject/pymatgen-test-files
(https://github.com/materialsproject/pymatgen-test-files), commit
85005108e99e40cbd59e78f067459b0ca664efc6, directory io/gaussian/.
tests/fixtures/qc/README.md lists each copy and its SHA-256.

The files are test data only. They are not part of any ReShiki binary or
package, keep their MIT terms (see LICENSE in this directory) and are not
represented as original dual-licensed ReShiki material.
